## Loop Decision

- If any blocker, major, or minor finding is listed above, keep this review as `needs-fix`, create a project fix log, revalidate, then create the next review round.
- Mark `status: pass` only when Blocker, Major, and Minor all say `None found.`
- Use accepted exceptions only when residual risk, skipped checks, and owner/date are documented in session or runlog evidence.

## Revalidation

```bash
python3 scripts/agent_check.py
python3 scripts/agent_migrate.py doctor
python3 scripts/agent_spec.py doctor
python3 scripts/agent_validate.py --list
python3 scripts/agent_runlog.py doctor
python3 scripts/agent_score.py doctor
python3 scripts/agent_score.py score --write

for tool in \
  scripts/agent_capabilities.py \
  scripts/agent_verify.py \
  scripts/agent_gc.py \
  .agent/tools/agent_memory.py \
  .agent/tools/agent_context.py \
  scripts/agent_tooling.py \
  scripts/agent_security.py; do
  if [ -f "$tool" ]; then
    python3 "$tool" doctor
  fi
done

if [ -f scripts/agent_sync_skills.py ]; then
  python3 scripts/agent_sync_skills.py --dry-run
fi
```
